try{PI18N.merge({"fr":{"💼 Your money at a glance":"💼 Votre argent en un coup d’œil","Billed":"Facturé","Paid":"Payé","Being confirmed":"En cours de confirmation","Still owed":"Reste dû","In credit":"En crédit","🧺 Choose what to pay":"🧺 Choisissez ce que vous payez","Tick the fees you want to pay now — change an amount to pay part of a fee. Fees collected by the same office go through one checkout: online, or one bank transfer.":"Cochez les frais à payer maintenant — modifiez un montant pour payer une partie d’un frais. Les frais perçus par le même service passent par un seul paiement : en ligne, ou un seul virement.","💳 Pay selected":"💳 Payer la sélection","🔄 Payments in progress":"🔄 Paiements en cours","Every step is also sent by e-mail and WhatsApp — to you and to your parent/guardian.":"Chaque étape est aussi envoyée par e-mail et WhatsApp — à vous et à votre parent/tuteur.","⏳ Waiting for the provider":"⏳ En attente du prestataire","❌ Did not go through":"❌ N’a pas abouti","🛡 Being checked":"🛡 En vérification","Waiting for the bank’s credit alert":"En attente de l’avis de crédit de la banque","Bank confirmed — receipt being issued":"Confirmé par la banque — reçu en cours d’émission","Paid — receipt issued":"Payé — reçu émis","Still waiting for the bank":"Toujours en attente de la banque","Amount differs from the bank":"Montant différent de celui de la banque","Being checked by the Bursary":"En vérification par la comptabilité","Please visit the Bursary":"Veuillez passer à la comptabilité","Closed — could not be verified":"Clôturé — vérification impossible","Received":"Reçu","Receipt read":"Reçu lu","Bank confirmed":"Confirmé par la banque","Receipt issued":"Reçu émis","We check the bank’s alerts every 30 minutes. Most transfers are confirmed within a few hours.":"Nous consultons les avis de la banque toutes les 30 minutes. La plupart des virements sont confirmés en quelques heures.","Some banks send their credit alerts late. We keep checking every 30 minutes and will message you the moment it arrives.":"Certaines banques envoient leurs avis de crédit en retard. Nous vérifions toutes les 30 minutes et vous écrirons dès qu’il arrive.","We are still waiting for the bank. The Bursary has been asked to check it by hand.":"Nous attendons toujours la banque. La comptabilité a été priée de vérifier manuellement.","The bank confirmed your transfer. The Bursary gives the final approval and your official receipt follows.":"La banque a confirmé votre virement. La comptabilité donne l’accord final, puis votre reçu officiel suit.","Your official receipt was sent by e-mail and WhatsApp and is in Receipts.":"Votre reçu officiel a été envoyé par e-mail et WhatsApp et se trouve dans Reçus.","The bank’s alert has not arrived yet. We keep watching for it (late alerts still count) and the Bursary is checking too.":"L’avis de la banque n’est pas encore arrivé. Nous continuons de le guetter (un avis tardif compte toujours) et la comptabilité vérifie aussi.","The bank credited a different amount than you entered. The Registry will review it — you may be asked for your bank statement.":"La banque a crédité un montant différent de celui saisi. Le rectorat va l’examiner — un relevé bancaire pourra vous être demandé.","A routine check that protects your money. Keep your bank receipt and statement ready in case the office asks for them.":"Une vérification de routine qui protège votre argent. Gardez votre reçu et votre relevé bancaires à portée au cas où le service les demande.","Bring your original proof of payment (bank receipt, teller or statement).":"Apportez votre preuve de paiement originale (reçu bancaire, bordereau ou relevé).","Visit the Bursary with your proof of payment if you believe this is a mistake.":"Passez à la comptabilité avec votre preuve de paiement si vous pensez qu’il s’agit d’une erreur.","Owed":"Dû","Bursary":"Comptabilité","Registry":"Rectorat","Student Affairs":"Vie étudiante","Faculty office":"Secrétariat de faculté","Phone number for the payment prompt":"Numéro de téléphone pour la demande de paiement","(slow right now)":"(lent en ce moment)","Selected":"Sélection","Total":"Total","Approve the payment on your phone":"Validez le paiement sur votre téléphone","Waiting for your approval…":"En attente de votre validation…","Try again":"Réessayer","Done":"Terminé","Still waiting. If you approved it, it shows up by itself — we keep checking and will message you.":"Toujours en attente. Si vous l’avez validé, il apparaîtra tout seul — nous continuons de vérifier et vous écrirons."},"es":{"💼 Your money at a glance":"💼 Su dinero de un vistazo","Billed":"Facturado","Paid":"Pagado","Being confirmed":"En confirmación","Still owed":"Pendiente","In credit":"A favor","🧺 Choose what to pay":"🧺 Elija qué pagar","Tick the fees you want to pay now — change an amount to pay part of a fee. Fees collected by the same office go through one checkout: online, or one bank transfer.":"Marque las tasas que desea pagar ahora — cambie un importe para pagar parte de una tasa. Las tasas de la misma oficina se pagan juntas: en línea o con una sola transferencia.","💳 Pay selected":"💳 Pagar lo seleccionado","🔄 Payments in progress":"🔄 Pagos en curso","Every step is also sent by e-mail and WhatsApp — to you and to your parent/guardian.":"Cada paso también se envía por correo y WhatsApp — a usted y a su padre/tutor.","⏳ Waiting for the provider":"⏳ Esperando al proveedor","❌ Did not go through":"❌ No se completó","🛡 Being checked":"🛡 En revisión","Waiting for the bank’s credit alert":"Esperando el aviso de abono del banco","Bank confirmed — receipt being issued":"Confirmado por el banco — recibo en emisión","Paid — receipt issued":"Pagado — recibo emitido","Still waiting for the bank":"Aún esperando al banco","Amount differs from the bank":"El importe difiere del banco","Being checked by the Bursary":"En revisión por Tesorería","Please visit the Bursary":"Por favor, acuda a Tesorería","Closed — could not be verified":"Cerrado — no se pudo verificar","Received":"Recibido","Receipt read":"Comprobante leído","Bank confirmed":"Confirmado por el banco","Receipt issued":"Recibo emitido","We check the bank’s alerts every 30 minutes. Most transfers are confirmed within a few hours.":"Revisamos los avisos del banco cada 30 minutos. La mayoría de las transferencias se confirman en pocas horas.","Some banks send their credit alerts late. We keep checking every 30 minutes and will message you the moment it arrives.":"Algunos bancos envían tarde sus avisos de abono. Seguimos revisando cada 30 minutos y le avisaremos en cuanto llegue.","We are still waiting for the bank. The Bursary has been asked to check it by hand.":"Seguimos esperando al banco. Se ha pedido a Tesorería que lo revise manualmente.","The bank confirmed your transfer. The Bursary gives the final approval and your official receipt follows.":"El banco confirmó su transferencia. Tesorería da la aprobación final y luego llega su recibo oficial.","Your official receipt was sent by e-mail and WhatsApp and is in Receipts.":"Su recibo oficial se envió por correo y WhatsApp y está en Recibos.","The bank’s alert has not arrived yet. We keep watching for it (late alerts still count) and the Bursary is checking too.":"El aviso del banco aún no ha llegado. Seguimos atentos (un aviso tardío también cuenta) y Tesorería también lo revisa.","The bank credited a different amount than you entered. The Registry will review it — you may be asked for your bank statement.":"El banco abonó un importe distinto del que indicó. Registro lo revisará — puede que le pidan su extracto bancario.","A routine check that protects your money. Keep your bank receipt and statement ready in case the office asks for them.":"Una revisión de rutina que protege su dinero. Tenga a mano su comprobante y su extracto bancario por si la oficina los pide.","Bring your original proof of payment (bank receipt, teller or statement).":"Traiga su comprobante de pago original (recibo bancario, boleta o extracto).","Visit the Bursary with your proof of payment if you believe this is a mistake.":"Acuda a Tesorería con su comprobante si cree que es un error.","Owed":"Adeudado","Bursary":"Tesorería","Registry":"Registro","Student Affairs":"Asuntos estudiantiles","Faculty office":"Oficina de facultad","Phone number for the payment prompt":"Número de teléfono para la solicitud de pago","(slow right now)":"(lento ahora)","Selected":"Seleccionado","Total":"Total","Approve the payment on your phone":"Apruebe el pago en su teléfono","Waiting for your approval…":"Esperando su aprobación…","Try again":"Reintentar","Done":"Listo","Still waiting. If you approved it, it shows up by itself — we keep checking and will message you.":"Aún en espera. Si lo aprobó, aparecerá solo — seguimos comprobando y le avisaremos."},"ar":{"💼 Your money at a glance":"💼 أموالك في لمحة","Billed":"المطلوب","Paid":"المدفوع","Being confirmed":"قيد التأكيد","Still owed":"المتبقي","In credit":"رصيد لصالحك","🧺 Choose what to pay":"🧺 اختر ما تريد دفعه","Tick the fees you want to pay now — change an amount to pay part of a fee. Fees collected by the same office go through one checkout: online, or one bank transfer.":"حدّد الرسوم التي تريد دفعها الآن — غيّر المبلغ لدفع جزء من الرسم. الرسوم التي يحصّلها المكتب نفسه تُدفع معًا: عبر الإنترنت أو بتحويل بنكي واحد.","💳 Pay selected":"💳 ادفع المحدد","🔄 Payments in progress":"🔄 مدفوعات قيد المعالجة","Every step is also sent by e-mail and WhatsApp — to you and to your parent/guardian.":"تُرسل كل خطوة أيضًا بالبريد الإلكتروني وواتساب — إليك وإلى وليّ أمرك.","⏳ Waiting for the provider":"⏳ بانتظار مزوّد الدفع","❌ Did not go through":"❌ لم تتم","🛡 Being checked":"🛡 قيد المراجعة","Waiting for the bank’s credit alert":"بانتظار إشعار الإيداع من البنك","Bank confirmed — receipt being issued":"أكّد البنك — يجري إصدار الإيصال","Paid — receipt issued":"مدفوع — صدر الإيصال","Still waiting for the bank":"ما زلنا ننتظر البنك","Amount differs from the bank":"المبلغ يختلف عمّا لدى البنك","Being checked by the Bursary":"قيد المراجعة لدى الشؤون المالية","Please visit the Bursary":"يرجى زيارة الشؤون المالية","Closed — could not be verified":"مغلق — تعذّر التحقق","Received":"تم الاستلام","Receipt read":"قُرئ الإيصال","Bank confirmed":"أكّد البنك","Receipt issued":"صدر الإيصال","We check the bank’s alerts every 30 minutes. Most transfers are confirmed within a few hours.":"نتحقق من إشعارات البنك كل 30 دقيقة. تُؤكَّد معظم التحويلات خلال ساعات قليلة.","Some banks send their credit alerts late. We keep checking every 30 minutes and will message you the moment it arrives.":"بعض البنوك ترسل إشعارات الإيداع متأخرة. نواصل التحقق كل 30 دقيقة وسنراسلك فور وصوله.","We are still waiting for the bank. The Bursary has been asked to check it by hand.":"ما زلنا ننتظر البنك. طُلب من الشؤون المالية التحقق يدويًا.","The bank confirmed your transfer. The Bursary gives the final approval and your official receipt follows.":"أكّد البنك تحويلك. تمنح الشؤون المالية الموافقة النهائية ثم يصلك إيصالك الرسمي.","Your official receipt was sent by e-mail and WhatsApp and is in Receipts.":"أُرسل إيصالك الرسمي بالبريد الإلكتروني وواتساب وهو في قسم الإيصالات.","The bank’s alert has not arrived yet. We keep watching for it (late alerts still count) and the Bursary is checking too.":"لم يصل إشعار البنك بعد. نواصل مراقبته (الإشعارات المتأخرة تُحتسب) والشؤون المالية تتحقق أيضًا.","The bank credited a different amount than you entered. The Registry will review it — you may be asked for your bank statement.":"أودع البنك مبلغًا مختلفًا عمّا أدخلته. ستراجعه المسجلية — قد يُطلب منك كشف حسابك.","A routine check that protects your money. Keep your bank receipt and statement ready in case the office asks for them.":"تحقق روتيني يحمي أموالك. احتفظ بإيصال البنك وكشف الحساب جاهزين في حال طلبهما المكتب.","Bring your original proof of payment (bank receipt, teller or statement).":"أحضر إثبات الدفع الأصلي (إيصال البنك أو قسيمة الإيداع أو الكشف).","Visit the Bursary with your proof of payment if you believe this is a mistake.":"تفضّل بزيارة الشؤون المالية مع إثبات الدفع إن كنت تعتقد أن هذا خطأ.","Owed":"مستحق","Bursary":"الشؤون المالية","Registry":"المسجلية","Student Affairs":"شؤون الطلاب","Faculty office":"مكتب الكلية","Phone number for the payment prompt":"رقم الهاتف لطلب الدفع","(slow right now)":"(بطيء الآن)","Selected":"المحدد","Total":"الإجمالي","Approve the payment on your phone":"وافق على الدفع من هاتفك","Waiting for your approval…":"بانتظار موافقتك…","Try again":"حاول مرة أخرى","Done":"تم","Still waiting. If you approved it, it shows up by itself — we keep checking and will message you.":"ما زلنا ننتظر. إن وافقت عليه فسيظهر تلقائيًا — نواصل التحقق وسنراسلك."},"ha":{"💼 Your money at a glance":"💼 Kuɗinka a taƙaice","Billed":"An caje","Paid":"An biya","Being confirmed":"Ana tabbatarwa","Still owed":"Saura bashi","In credit":"Ragowar kuɗi","🧺 Choose what to pay":"🧺 Zaɓi abin da za ka biya","Tick the fees you want to pay now — change an amount to pay part of a fee. Fees collected by the same office go through one checkout: online, or one bank transfer.":"Zaɓi kuɗaɗen da kake son biya yanzu — canza adadi don biyan wani ɓangare. Kuɗaɗen ofishi ɗaya ana biyan su tare: ta intanet, ko ta tura kuɗi sau ɗaya a banki.","💳 Pay selected":"💳 Biya waɗanda aka zaɓa","🔄 Payments in progress":"🔄 Biyan da ke gudana","Every step is also sent by e-mail and WhatsApp — to you and to your parent/guardian.":"Ana kuma aiko kowane mataki ta imel da WhatsApp — zuwa gare ka da iyayenka/mai kula da kai.","⏳ Waiting for the provider":"⏳ Ana jiran mai sarrafa biya","❌ Did not go through":"❌ Bai yiwu ba","🛡 Being checked":"🛡 Ana dubawa","Waiting for the bank’s credit alert":"Ana jiran sanarwar shigar kuɗi daga banki","Bank confirmed — receipt being issued":"Banki ya tabbatar — ana fitar da rasit","Paid — receipt issued":"An biya — an fitar da rasit","Still waiting for the bank":"Har yanzu ana jiran banki","Amount differs from the bank":"Adadin ya bambanta da na banki","Being checked by the Bursary":"Ofishin kuɗi na dubawa","Please visit the Bursary":"Don Allah ka ziyarci ofishin kuɗi","Closed — could not be verified":"An rufe — ba a iya tabbatarwa ba","Received":"An karɓa","Receipt read":"An karanta rasit","Bank confirmed":"Banki ya tabbatar","Receipt issued":"An fitar da rasit","We check the bank’s alerts every 30 minutes. Most transfers are confirmed within a few hours.":"Muna duba sanarwar banki kowane minti 30. Yawancin tura kuɗi ana tabbatar da su cikin ’yan sa’o’i.","Some banks send their credit alerts late. We keep checking every 30 minutes and will message you the moment it arrives.":"Wasu bankuna suna jinkirin aiko sanarwar shigar kuɗi. Muna ci gaba da dubawa kowane minti 30 kuma za mu sanar da kai da zarar ta iso.","We are still waiting for the bank. The Bursary has been asked to check it by hand.":"Har yanzu muna jiran banki. An roƙi ofishin kuɗi ya duba da hannu.","The bank confirmed your transfer. The Bursary gives the final approval and your official receipt follows.":"Banki ya tabbatar da tura kuɗinka. Ofishin kuɗi zai ba da amincewa ta ƙarshe, sannan rasit ɗinka na hukuma zai biyo.","Your official receipt was sent by e-mail and WhatsApp and is in Receipts.":"An aiko rasit ɗinka na hukuma ta imel da WhatsApp kuma yana cikin Rasit.","The bank’s alert has not arrived yet. We keep watching for it (late alerts still count) and the Bursary is checking too.":"Sanarwar banki ba ta iso ba tukuna. Muna ci gaba da jira (sanarwar da ta makara ma tana aiki) kuma ofishin kuɗi ma yana dubawa.","The bank credited a different amount than you entered. The Registry will review it — you may be asked for your bank statement.":"Banki ya shigar da adadin da ya bambanta da wanda ka rubuta. Ofishin rajista zai duba — ana iya neman bayanin asusunka na banki.","A routine check that protects your money. Keep your bank receipt and statement ready in case the office asks for them.":"Dubawa ce ta yau da kullum da ke kare kuɗinka. Ajiye rasit da bayanin asusunka na banki a shirye idan ofishin ya nema.","Bring your original proof of payment (bank receipt, teller or statement).":"Kawo ainihin shaidar biya (rasit na banki, takardar ajiya ko bayanin asusu).","Visit the Bursary with your proof of payment if you believe this is a mistake.":"Ka ziyarci ofishin kuɗi da shaidar biya idan kana ganin kuskure ne.","Owed":"Bashi","Bursary":"Ofishin kuɗi","Registry":"Ofishin rajista","Student Affairs":"Harkokin ɗalibai","Faculty office":"Ofishin tsangaya","Phone number for the payment prompt":"Lambar waya don saƙon biya","(slow right now)":"(yana jinkiri yanzu)","Selected":"Abin da aka zaɓa","Total":"Jimilla","Approve the payment on your phone":"Amince da biyan a wayarka","Waiting for your approval…":"Ana jiran amincewarka…","Try again":"Sake gwadawa","Done":"An gama","Still waiting. If you approved it, it shows up by itself — we keep checking and will message you.":"Har yanzu ana jira. Idan ka amince, zai bayyana da kansa — muna ci gaba da dubawa kuma za mu sanar da kai."}});}catch(_){}
